{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12303660","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12303660","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230366001:1":{"text":"가격은 제 기분에 따라 달라요.","source_cn":"看眼缘卖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2438D9668626660D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230366002:1":{"text":"만약 당신이 소니아 같은 사람이라면... 선물로 줄 수도 있고요.","source_cn":"如果你是像索尼娅那样的人……送你也行呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA51FF5CB79008E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230366003:1":{"text":"어라? 절 왜 그렇게 보세요? 제가 소니아를 존경하는 게 그렇게 이상한 일인가요?","source_cn":"咦，怎么这样看着人家？人家崇拜索尼娅，是很奇怪的事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF48BEDBD8797020F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230366004:1":{"text":"소니아는 이 세상에서 가장 멋진 사람이라고요!","source_cn":"索尼娅可是这个世界上最帅气的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA903C95808FA178A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230366005:1":{"text":"당신이 그녀를 봤다면 절 이해했을 거예요.","source_cn":"如果你见过她，就会理解人家的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87B367425B019099","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卖花女格妮":{"text":"꽃팔이 그니","source":"卖花女格妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":1}}